              "label": "Grievance Officer",
              "p": "M Aveen, Founder\nOmnara India Private Limited, Door No. 10-40, Middeladon, Medarametla, Korisapadu, Bodduvaripalem, Ongole, Prakasam – 523212, Andhra Pradesh, India\ncontact@inflx.in · +91 86394 48121"
